'''Nekonosuke''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Capsule during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 477
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nekonosuke
|name2 = Old Guardian Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Old Guardian Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
You can use this unit as a somewhat more expensive and more powerful [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]], similar to a {{4c}} [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]]. With its decently high health and damage, on top of Area Attack, it is surprisingly usable against [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred-Aliens]], though its low range and lack of [[Immune to Warp|Warp Immunity]] or [[Barrier]] [[Barrier Breaker|Breaker]] make it hard to use against [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|starred-Aliens]].

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

